close_reason: "Pins: @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.21 -> 2026.9.23, pm-changelog 2026.9.18 -> 2026.9.23 (package.json and package-lock.json). git config lists the pm merge drivers; the CI health block runs green with --require-merge-drivers; release:check exits 0."
